{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/677597-empire-city-by-night-rage-across-new-york-city","id":677597,"title":"Empire City by Night (Rage Across New York City)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-25T07:41:39-07:00","id":677597,"title":"Empire City by Night (Rage Across New York City)","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><div align=\"center\"><img src=\"http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v304/HadrianST/Empire%20City/Empire%20City_zpssi5rxcjx.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div><hr /></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Empire City by Night (Rage Across New York City)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">http://www.empirecitybynight.com/</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Empire City by Night is an online role-playing community set in the Big Apple \u2013 New York City, centered upon Werewolf the Apocalypse and the Classic World of Darkness. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Mission Statement</b></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Empire City will be a decentralized storytelling system, where the yoke of responsibility is a shared, cooperative endeavor. This means players will - in some ways - storytell for one another and hold the power of life and death of any given character in their hands. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Empire City will be a polished, fully fleshed out sandbox. Age has taught me to disregard popularity contests and appreciate quality workmanship. As for those missing pieces in my Return of the Jedi Deathstar; well, I\u2019m working as fast as life will allow.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Code of Conduct</b></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">\u2022 Empire City by Night is merely a medium for role-playing Werewolf the Apocalypse, specifically set in the World of Darkness, and it is not intended to be a mechanism to mend or placate self esteem issues, enact social change, or split hairs over subjective matters.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">\u2022 Adult themes and graphic horror is not only permitted but encouraged; however, unlawful content involving minors, age 18 or below, will not be tolerated. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">\u2022 Storytellers, administrators, and writers are all capable of artistic expression and personal interpretation of White Wolf canon, undoubtedly making concerns and disagreements unavoidable; however, in the interest of the community, all members are expected to conduct themselves as adults.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">\u2022 Do not assume Storytellers' imaginations are limited by the books. In the spirit of savage horror, suspense, and surprise, be prepared for some stout home-brew.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Courier New\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">\u2022 New York, as presented, is a hybrid blend of Rage Across New York, Montreal by Night, Midnight Siege, and an amalgamation of the city\u2019s worst features, black-eyed history, and left out in the sun to bloat. The result is the Gothic Punk World of Darkness: New York Mk I as interpreted and presented by your Storytellers. This is not a venue for historical reenactment or source-book debate.</span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8068-evil-anvil","name":"Evil Anvil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8068_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}